<title>USA: Republic Industries buys Florida car firm.</title>
<headline>Republic Industries buys Florida car firm.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said it has bought Florida car dealership Carlisle Motors for about $35 million.</p>
<p>Carlisle owns and operates dealerships in St Petersburg and Clearwater, Fla.</p>
<p>The acquisition is the latest purchase by Republic, which recently has bought other car dealerships and top rental car companies Alamo and National. Republic is led by billionaire investor Wayne Huizenga.</p>
<p>Republic said the transaction will be accounted for as a pooling-of-interests.</p>
</text>
